Package: xucinet
Title: UCINET-Style Social Network Analysis in R
Version: 2.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stephen", "Borgatti", , "sborgatti@uky.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5776-5579")),
    person("Filip", "Agneessens", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2705-3535")),
    person("Martin", "Everett", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2465-1329")))
Description: Social network analysis routines that mirror UCINET in concepts,
    names, numerical results and printed output, so that a UCINET user can move
    to R and back without relearning anything except R punctuation. Companion
    package to 'Analyzing Social Networks Using R', 2nd edition (Sage).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    igraph,
    network,
    sna,
    jsonlite,
    readxl,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/sborgatti/xucinet
BugReports: https://github.com/sborgatti/xucinet/issues
